  "raw_output": "{\n  \"exercis_type\": \"CEFR Englis_Placement Test\",\n  \"section_id\": 5,\n  \"section_title\": \"Reading Comprehension\",\n  \"cefr_range\": \"B2-C1\",\n  \"reading_text\": \"\\\\\nIn the bustling city of New York, where skyscrapers reach for the heavens and people move with a speed that can be overwhelming, there's an unassuming café called The Cozy Corner. \\\\n\\\\\nLocated in a quiet corner of the busy street, it has managed to maintain its charm despite the constant flow of traffic outside. The walls are adorned with vintage posters and framed photographs that seem to tell stories from different eras. \\\\n\\\\\nThe Cozy Corner is not just a place where you can have a coffee; it's a haven for local artists, writers, and students who come here to work on their projects or simply enjoy the company of others. The café has an uncanny way of drawing people in with its warm atmosphere and friendly staff.\",\n  \"questions\": [\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 36,\n      \"question\": \"What is the main purpose of The Cozy Corner?\",\\\n      \"options\": [\\\n        \"To serve fast food.\",\\\n        \"To provide a quiet space for people to work and socialize.\",\\\n        \"To host large events in the city.\",\\\n        \"To sell art supplies.\"\\\n      ],\\\n      \"answer\": \"To provide a quiet space for people to work and socialize.\"\\\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 37,\\\n      \"question\": \"Which of the following describes The Cozy Corner's atmosphere?\",\\\n      \"options\": [\\\n        \"Loud and chaotic.\",\\\n        \"Warm and inviting.\",\\\n        \"Dark and mysterious.\",\\\n        \"Bold and extravagant.\"\\\n      ],\\\n      \"answer\": \"Warm and inviting.\"\\\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 38,\\\n      \"question\": \"What can be inferred about the café's customers?\",\\\n      \"options\": [\\\n        \"They are mainly tourists.\",\\\n        \"They come for its fast food service.\",\\\n        \"They enjoy working or socializing in a quiet setting.\",\\\n        \"They prefer noisy atmospheres.\"\\\n      ],\\\n      \"answer\": \"They enjoy working or socializing in a quiet setting.\"\\\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 39,\\\n      \"question\": \"What does the phrase 'uncanny way' imply about The Cozy Corner?\",\\\n      \"options\": [\\\n        \"It has a magical influence on people.\",\\\n        \"People are unable to resist its appeal.\",\\\n        \"The café is difficult to find in the city.\",\\\n        \"It's a coincidence that people visit frequently.\"\\\n      ],\\\n      \"answer\": \"People are unable to resist its appeal.\"\\\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 40,\\\n      \"question\": \"Which of the following statements best describes The Cozy Corner?\",\\\n      \"options\": [\\\n        \"A bustling restaurant with a large menu.\",\\\n        \"A trendy café known for its unique decor.\",\\\n        \"An intimate space where people can work and socialize in peace.\",\\\n        \"A bookstore with a limited selection of novels.\"\\\n      ],\\\n      \"answer\": \"An intimate space where people can work and socialize in peace.\"\\\n    }\n  ]\n}",
